    "name":  "12W LED Wall Light VIBORG Outdoor",
    "reference":  "90437-3K",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWall light LED VIBORG 12W\u003c/strong\u003e, type of protection \u003cstrong\u003eIP65\u003c/strong\u003e, so its use has resistance to any sudden change of temperature, both in winter and summer. This\u003cstrong\u003e black outdoor wall lamp\u003c/strong\u003e is especially suitable for lighting outdoor areas giving them a modern design. Create relaxing environments to enjoy your garden, entrances, porches, etc...\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e12W LED Wall Light VIBORG Outdoor\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur \u003cstrong\u003e12W LED wall light\u003c/strong\u003e allows you to obtain a personalised lighting thanks to customised installation, according to the required ambiance. It presents a warm and cosy light. It is perfect for \u003cstrong\u003eindoors\u003c/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003eoutdoors\u003c/strong\u003e, thanks to its IP65, which makes it resistant to rain splashes.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese LED wall lights reduce energy consumption by up to 80% compared to the old halogen lamps, in addition to the fact that their materials are less polluting for the planet. \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eUses 12W LED Wall Light VIBORG Outdoor\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWalls\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCorridors\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRooms\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHotels\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEntrances\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePorches\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://www.factorled.com/img/cms/Ambientadas/Sensor-Crepuscular-Factorled.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"394\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn Factorled we ensure that our products have QUALITY guarantee and offer all the necessary elements for DISTRIBUTION, IMPORT OR WHOLESALE, including the technical data sheet of each LED product.\u003c/p\u003e",
